. Watch the backlog and whether data center buildouts are on time. Tue Nov 10: Football Manager 27 comes out on PC, Mac, PS5 and Xbox Series X|S. FM26 got a mixed reception last year, so this one has to win the regulars back. Tue Nov 10: Adobe MAX starts in Miami Beach, through Thu Nov 12 – Adobe's yearly drop of Firefly and Creative Cloud features. See how far the AI tools go into Photoshop and Premiere. Thu Nov 12: Metaphor: ReFantazio arrives on Switch 2 – Atlus's 2024 RPG, one of that year's best-reviewed games, finally portable. Thu Nov 12: Cisco reports fiscal Q1 after the close – it guided to $18.0B–$18.2B in revenue. AI networking orders from the big clouds are the number that matters. See it coming.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/i0hJMDXQelmjFSRG-BdW0OSy1vcmktHvVK0-dgltF9Nnsa8OkUyxgBfaONmPkzknoU02nCmHRFS6EFNDzjqYiednUFH3-dOlFR9Ib77QRx5gMFUtEw01loxgfBex4c90ehtOXN6P9mSYB8YDh13rCWl8TgaZqg5DefbeA6EFWnwZGaa214FbZZwthN8q4G8qU2N1J9_ZzcmLA2RQAG1dnLO_AyD6Zj4hPRa1clqPZosWWjf1JG0MokD5iVFcR7CtxRTt8dQWlRj52xcr1P1EHijyNOR3YueO6dPZn37TmfMdgZ4trX7C8cke6oblmUujBc9B2DUM8HkUKEacST8RxQ.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"1229","date":"2026-11-08T19:09:15+00:00","text":"5 underrated PlayStation App features Read on Engadget","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/bo22Nx_4HmllcYEx_mQy0JdcVMKp75P9EMWQ5W0nODXQjoKgvpwj3PE_BB-QvR1q7bj1v-k1i3lQ14Vxy1wr_27CzQgHXJl4FT9oZMyGkg2VCGaDbARp7_f03zwsU-DswOtYoc0imFayuB4SjP6TK34SqLhr0nDBxM-eEqjcZLEmEBdY-Y3Bv8pIwJVTfzzd87Kau111uBnUiOWkXFfBjcxauXb2CGo0wZdBZWovH1krRHw85Eaz0hdQBEdWljQ06cW8F8f_7vfRa4J5xvTNE6tb2kqv-NdeizlEAhrfSXTU8es1UDIe7js9575YsIPufhh-wUiomfK2bdi5UA-38w.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"1228","date":"2026-11-08T18:54:35+00:00","text":"Why 2TB of phone storage makes more sense than you think Read on Engadget","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Z1GGkKe7cWVf90Va1mi8I1nUcg-G_qR1BGH3tx8v5209_YG0nIbYElAc5Eqcx5WLgLLwIq2GP-J1CuRKSQF1Ak-lbiHwwZ-aw0ph6jCBmI8mjU8NeuAgaTrEdibqOnrhrkGFUte8VAHq0T9OrSSe0hLZptNzlqFZlXzpowmXoo